<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n79901" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρωτίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>,
			ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὖς</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>tumour of the parotid gland</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				2.80
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				16.484
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>lobe of the ear</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				1402
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>lock of hair</i> or <i>curl by the ear</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				2.28
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> Archit., 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὖς</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				11.2
			</span></i>, <i>ornament depending from the end of the</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπέρθυρον, λίθοι παρωτίδες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Rev.Phil.</u>
					44.250
				</span></i>
			 (Didyma, <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Vitr.
				4.6.4
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
